          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hi!",
          "transl": "Привіт!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "PROUD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Greetings, \\v[lore.title.seeker].\\. Everything's still running smoothly down here.",
          "transl": "Glück auf, Seeker!\\. Hier fluppt alles wunderbar."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "miners.male-brownshirt-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Too smoothly perhaps... there haven't been any recent attacks, but those bugs might just gather their strength.",
          "transl": "Zu wunderbar vielleicht... Es gab keine weiteren Angriffe, was aber nix heißt. Vielleicht bündeln sie grad nur ihre Kräfte."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "miners.male-brownshirt-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!",
          "transl": "...!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Fortunately, those crawlers are not expecting the wonder that is \\c[3]our highly-advanced nanosound-device\\c[0]!",
          "transl": "Aber diese Krabbler rechnen niemals mit unserer technischen Geheimwaffe, dem \\c[3]Nanoschallgenerator!\\c[0]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "miners.male-brownshirt-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...?",
          "transl": "...?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NERVOUS"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "We could use that to lure them in and then preemptively reduce their numbers.\\. How about it?",
          "transl": "Wir könnten ihn verwenden, um sie zu ködern und vorsorglich auszumerzen.\\. Bist du dabei?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "miners.male-brownshirt-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "accepted": [
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "[nods]",
            "transl": "[киває]"
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "NOD"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Excellent!\\. Just enter the chamber again.\\. I'll prepare everything for you!",
            "transl": "Töffte!\\. Geh einfach nochmal in die Kammer.\\. Ich bereite alles für dich vor."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "miners.male-brownshirt-white",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Just a warning: \\c[3]The nanosounds will most likely make them really angry\\c[0].\\. So expect even \\c[3]more aggression\\c[0] than before.",
            "transl": "Kleine Vorwarnung: \\c[3]Der Nanoschall wird sie wahrscheinlich sehr wütend machen\\c[0].\\. Rechne also mit \\c[3]noch mehr Aggressivität\\c[0] als zuvor."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "miners.male-brownshirt-white",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "...!",
            "transl": "...!"
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "SURPRISED"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "Oh, I'm sure you will do just fine!",
            "transl": "Du schaffst dat schon!"
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "miners.male-brownshirt-white",
            "expression": "DEFAULT"
           }
          },
          {
           "message": {
            "orig": "...",
            "transl": "..."
           },
           "person": {
            "person": "main.lea",
            "expression": "DETERMINED"
